    {
      "content": "Got so Friday, so just we're just slightly more expensive on Fridays and Saturdays. So, essentially the way that our pricing works is we're $110 an hour per mover on Fridays and Saturdays. So that'd be a $200 and a 220 hourly rate. But we are $105 per mover on Monday through Thursday. So it'd be a $210 hourly rate. So it's a difference of $10 an hour but either way with us, the way that our pricing works, it's just that $200 something dollars an hour for, however long the move takes we will wrap everything, we'll disassemble things, we'll reassemble them it is all inclusive. Moving, there's no other fees, there's no travel fees, there's no material costs, there's no tax.",
